	(text "USB-C for SMARTPHONE"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
				(thickness 0.6096)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "071dbbf8-0cf0-4b7b-a43a-922f88ba4084")
	)
	(text "VBUS_5V lockout: the robot 5 V (TMI6240 + Q27) can only\nturn on while VBUS_5V is ~0 V. Q33 holds PWR_EN_G low if a\nphone already sources VBUS_5V; once on, Q34 latches it.\n\nPD power-role swap lets the robot charge the phone while it stays host. Q27 blocks the phone's\nVBUS_5V from back-feeding the robot 5 V (the TMI6240 body diode conducts VOUT->VIN);\nUSB_PWR_EN turns on TMI6240 and Q27 together.\nTMI6240 now runs from VSENS-5V-USB (U25 buck removed)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 43.18 124.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2e48c1f9-9ef5-442e-9a2d-e3b868dfade2")
	)
	(text "USB-C (phone): phone is the USB host. CC1/CC2 go to the MCU UCPD (PB6/PB4): Rd by default."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 158.75 151.892 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "41c3bc55-4606-4ddf-a7d6-287a90767fc0")
	)
	(text "VBUS to VMCU-3V3 (bring-up)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 138.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5fd58ece-713b-4668-91e0-f4f9904cdedd")
	)
	(text "Bring-up power: a PC USB-A port (USB-A to USB-C cable) runs the STM32 with the battery out,\nfor the first flash (J1 BOOT0 jumper + USB DFU) and for flashing the dock over SWIO. 100 mA max: keep VSENS-3V3 off.\nBattery out: R231 pulls the Q39 gate to GND; U27 reaches VMCU-3V3 through the Q39 body diode, then Q39 turns on (3.3 V).\nBattery in: R230/R231 hold the gate at P+/2 (6-8.4 V, Vgs <= +8.4 V), so Q39 is off and U27 is isolated:\nno load sharing with U21, and a phone on USB-C can't keep the MCU alive. ~8 uA from the battery.\nP+/C+14V4, not VBAT-14V4: with the battery out, VBAT-14V4 is back-fed to ~2.5 V through U21."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 173.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9141d06e-c015-4b2e-b270-b7070714659a")
	)
	(text "Not required"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 97.79 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e09539ec-ca41-481e-9175-668075dbb44d")
	)
